WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.767
Welcome to Module 1 Understanding Data in
Informatics This

00:00:05.794 --> 00:00:11.796
module is the foundation for the rest of IAN 603
Before we clean transform

00:00:11.915 --> 00:00:16.257
query or model data we need to understand what the
data represents how it is

00:00:16.283 --> 00:00:21.988
organized and whether it is trustworthy enough for
the task We will use small

00:00:22.001 --> 00:00:28.463
examples and one running patient-encounter dataset
so the ideas remain concrete The

00:00:28.490 --> 00:00:34.005
goal is not to memorize vocabulary The goal is to
build a habit understand

00:00:34.019 --> 00:00:36.650
the data first then make technical decisions
